# Schemas vs database

`@repo/schemas` is Zod for request bodies, tokens, and events.

`@repo/db/schema` is Drizzle tables and column enums.

```ts
// BAD
import { projects, runs } from '@repo/schemas';

// GOOD
import { projects, runs } from '@repo/db/schema';
import { CreateRunBodySchema } from '@repo/schemas';
```

Do not import `@repo/agent-client` from a `'use server'` file just to get a status string. Use the database run status (`running`, `completed`, `failed`) when writing rows.
